家：<a href="http://www.tongjiewipes.com/" target="_blank">点此查看官网</a>（可重点看合作伙伴）</p></li><h2>关于 AVENT</h2></ul><p>飞利浦自 2006 年全资收购“英国新安怡 AVENT”后，商标、研发、标准全归飞利浦集团持有，官方名称统一为「Philips AVENT 飞利浦新安怡」。</p><p>全产品线纳入飞利浦全球售后体系，400 官方统一保修，属于飞利浦正规自营产品线。</p><p>新安怡英国自有工厂 2020 年关停，目前大多数产品产地为中国。</p><p>2021 年飞利浦卖掉的是“大家电 / 厨房小家电业务”，新安怡所在的是“个人健康业务”，目前仍由荷兰飞利浦全资自有。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1250" src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/119986475/O1CN01whJ5ry1xhbcqMy1Cz_!!119986475.jpg" title="老哥反馈还不错：飞利浦新安怡 0.07 元 / 抽闭眼囤，物理擦去 99.9% 细菌" width="790" /><img height="1249" src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/119986475/O1CN01X0XRIs1xhbcsH3gO9_!!119986475.jpg" title="老哥反馈还不错：飞利浦新安怡 0.07 元 / 抽闭眼囤，物理擦去 99.9% 细菌" width="790" /><img height="937" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/fda8d07d-23a9-4dd4-9b5b-e8ffea4d1bca.jpg" title="老哥反馈还不错：飞利浦新安怡 0.07 元 / 抽闭眼囤，物理擦去 99.9% 细菌" width="790" /><img height="427" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/11c8bf71-11c9-46c2-92c4-867fd824beea.jpg" title="老哥反馈还不错：飞利浦新安怡 0.07 元 / 抽闭眼囤，物理擦去 99.9% 细菌" width="790" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=E%2FoMsU8s3qGlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJ3P6TVKHpsifgl8wMwV5IsMMNrF8aYBlOWU2GsH5YFvSj4Zl0xfHjgGwU7M92V%2BYeRSHvQe2jOLZ9pbNCYX0I%2BPP%2BWUTgK%2F%2B0DI9LnV2RxzN7CtXivpqDNUYHGrualSPSqH7w7k9a4XNXM3PDc0jBTBHtR5M9fhgNtsfGA5CFJLDe4LCSMIu01NeqSq5uaIh97jKjAO7pxYgdIMeVz1KiUVWTcG2AD5UojtkJsPZ7MmJElyhL9GejyEX16jvoxuz8r%2BoGdRT5%2B9J%2BOHfs5nLQGA%3D%3D&amp;traceId=215046c417867001557846728e0f7c&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1786700155@21278f5e_13f0_19fffa0cbce_b4c6@01&amp;activityId=f2b90d436b5d4171b2918d6c17661897" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i1/119986475/O1CN01Rns0Zg1xhbgRDqnG1_!!4611686018427386155-0-item_pic.jpg" title="老哥反馈还不错：飞利浦新安怡 0.07 元 / 抽闭眼囤，物理擦去 99.9% 细菌" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><sp